# A pad state stuck holding 2 of the 3 combo buttons (a lost release frame:
# FPGA pads only report changes) must stop blocking main-menu navigation
# after ~1.5s, while still stuck. The heartbeat keeps moving throughout, so
# the watchdog alone would never rescue this (#29).
expect-screen "TangCore"
expect-cursor-row 9
stuck select+start
expect-alive 2s
press down
expect-cursor-row 10
unstuck
press down
expect-cursor-row 11
